==============================================================================
Third-party software
==============================================================================

The Java SDK declares, but does not bundle, these dependencies (resolved by
Maven/Gradle from their upstream sources):

  - JSpecify 1.0.0 (Apache-2.0)                annotations
  - Google RE2/J 1.8 (Go-style license)        linear-time regex for guardrails
  - Spring Boot / Spring AI (Apache-2.0)       optional integrations
  - SLF4J (MIT), Micrometer (Apache-2.0),     optional observability
    OpenTelemetry (Apache-2.0)
  - JUnit 5, AssertJ (Apache-2.0)              test scopes

The TypeScript and Python REST clients and the Python agent SDK have no
runtime third-party dependencies.

